<view class="page"><view class="title">版本比较</view><view class="intro">比较已保存的成片和片段参数，不重新生成。手机使用同一播放器切换两侧，便于比较声音和画面。</view><picker range="{{names}}" value="{{rightIndex}}" bindchange="rightChange" disabled="{{loading}}"><view class="input">另一版本：{{names[rightIndex] || '暂无其他成片'}}</view></picker><button class="secondary" wx:if="{{more}}" bindtap="moreWorks" disabled="{{loading}}">加载更多版本</button><button class="primary" bindtap="startCompare" disabled="{{loading || !items.length}}">载入比较</button><block wx:if="{{comparison}}"><view class="card"><view>左：{{comparison.left.revision_number ? 'v' + comparison.left.revision_number : '原始清单'}} · {{comparison.left.duration}}秒 · {{comparison.left.resolution.width}}×{{comparison.left.resolution.height}}</view><view>右：{{comparison.right.revision_number ? 'v' + comparison.right.revision_number : '原始清单'}} · {{comparison.right.duration}}秒 · {{comparison.right.resolution.width}}×{{comparison.right.resolution.height}}</view><view class="small">左轨道：{{leftTracks}}</view><view class="small">右轨道：{{rightTracks}}</view><view class="small">{{comparison.timing_note}}</view><view class="actions"><button class="small-button" bindtap="viewSide" data-side="0" disabled="{{loading || !comparison.left.can_preview}}">查看左版/刷新授权</button><button class="small-button" bindtap="viewSide" data-side="1" disabled="{{loading || !comparison.right.can_preview}}">查看右版/刷新授权</button></view><video id="comparisonVideo" wx:if="{{url}}" src="{{url}}" controls object-fit="contain" style="width:100%;height:600rpx" bindloadedmetadata="loaded" bindtimeupdate="timeUpdate" binderror="videoError"/><view wx:if="{{url}}">当前查看{{side === 0 ? '左' : '右'}}版</view><input class="input" value="{{time}}" bindinput="timeInput" placeholder="共同成片时间（秒）"/><button class="secondary" bindtap="seek">定位到共同时间</button></view><view class="card-title">片段差异 {{comparison.total_changes}} 项</view><view class="card" wx:for="{{changes}}" wx:key="clip_id"><view class="card-title">{{item.title}}</view><button class="small-button" bindtap="toggleDiff" data-id="{{item.clip_id}}">展开/收起完整对照</button><view class="candidate" wx:for="{{item.fields}}" wx:for-item="field" wx:key="name"><view>{{field.name}}</view><view class="small">左：{{expanded === item.clip_id ? field.fullBefore : field.before}}</view><view class="small">右：{{expanded === item.clip_id ? field.fullAfter : field.after}}</view></view></view><view class="muted" wx:if="{{!changes.length}}">没有片段参数差异，可继续比较规格或实际播放。</view><button class="secondary" wx:if="{{moreChanges}}" bindtap="moreDiffs" disabled="{{loading}}">加载更多差异</button></block><view class="status">{{status}}</view></view>
